    <briefdescription>
<para>This is the primary header file that users should include to access the hipDNN frontend API. It provides a high-level C++ interface for building and executing deep learning computational graphs on AMD GPUs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The hipDNN Frontend provides a graph-based API for constructing deep learning operations including:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Convolution operations (forward, data gradient, weight gradient)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Batch normalization (forward, backward, inference)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Pointwise/element-wise operations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Matrix multiplication</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<sect1 id="hipdnn__frontend_8hpp_1usage">
<title>Basic usage</title>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&lt;<ref refid="hipdnn__frontend_8hpp" kindref="compound">hipdnn_frontend.hpp</ref>&gt;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">using<sp/>namespace<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">hipdnn_frontend;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">using<sp/>namespace<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">hipdnn_frontend::graph;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Create<sp/>a<sp/>graph</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Graph<sp/>graph;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">graph.set_io_data_type(DataType::HALF)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.set_compute_data_type(DataType::FLOAT);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Create<sp/>tensors</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>x<sp/>=<sp/>Graph::tensor(TensorAttributes()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.set_dim({1,<sp/>64,<sp/>28,<sp/>28})</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.set_stride({50176,<sp/>784,<sp/>28,<sp/>1})</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.set_data_type(DataType::HALF));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Add<sp/>operations<sp/>and<sp/>build<sp/>the<sp/>graph</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="hipdnn__backend_8h_1a33910be0bef9f56e913ec10712a6494f" kindref="member">hipdnnHandle_t</ref><sp/>handle;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="hipdnn__backend_8h_1a324561ed97fee17c8d93151d2495b9bb" kindref="member">hipdnnCreate</ref>(&amp;handle);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">graph.build(handle);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Execute</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">graph.execute(handle,<sp/>tensorLookup,<sp/>workspace);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
